# Normalize every text file to LF in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# Run manifests record the SHA-256 of the snapshot file they consumed. Without
# this, a Windows checkout produces CRLF snapshots whose hash does not match the
# hash a Linux or macOS checkout produces, and the recorded evidence fails to
# verify on the platform the reader happens to use.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
